message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "die_another_day: ICARUS — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package for Die Another Day (2002), mission codename ICARUS.
  Implements biometric identity-replacement detection, ice-palace
  cold-environment operations planning, and orbital-mirror targeting as pure,
  deterministic domain modules behind a frozen BOND-API MissionProvider.
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
